      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow1:018",
        "answer": "Builds dead-spectator presentation: calling card receives complete element model, playerName and objectiveCameraText use opposite followingObjective predicates, and playerIndex updates cleaned name/clan labels. A separate PlayerName uses GetClientName; playerXuid updates emblem. All value callbacks ignore nil. Constructs both normal and PC spectating bars in this recovered span; the PC-looking name is not a construction gate. Registers close, optional postload, returns self. Spectator choice, data production, visual state dispatch and native teardown remain external.",
